{"seq":3,"slug":"risk-event-remediation-exit","title":"高风险事件响应、整改与退出（扣关/暂停/替代供应）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/supplier-esg-diversity-sourcing-compliance/supply-chain-esg-risk/risk-event-remediation-exit","wordCount":2848,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"高风险事件响应-整改与退出-扣关-暂停-替代供应\">高风险事件响应、整改与退出（扣关/暂停/替代供应）</h1><p>扣关在风险评分表里只是 <code>Critical</code> 那一行，落到运营上却是一个带倒计时的工单：货已压在港口，仓储费按天计，进口商要在法定窗口内交出证据或承担退运成本。高风险事件的工程问题不是「怎么打分」，而是「时钟开始走之后，系统能不能自动冻结该冻结的订单、调齐该调的证据、启动该启动的替代货源」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p><strong>风险事件（risk event）</strong> 是一次把供应商从「准入」推到「阻断」的外部或内部信号：CBP 的扣留通知、主管机关的核查函、审计发现的 Major 缺陷、媒体或 NGO 的指控。它区别于常规风险信号的关键在于<strong>不可逆的时钟</strong>——扣关有举证窗口，暂停有客户交付承诺，退出有爬坡周期，任何一步拖延都直接变成成本。成熟系统把响应拆成三个可独立度量的面：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  EV[风险事件触发] --&gt; TR[应急响应面&lt;br/&gt;停损 / 在途货处置]&#10;  EV --&gt; REM[整改面&lt;br/&gt;CAP 工单 / 复评]&#10;  EV --&gt; EX[退出面&lt;br/&gt;替代货源 / 有序终止]&#10;  TR --&gt; FREEZE[订单冻结与在途隔离]&#10;  TR --&gt; ADMIT{扣关举证}&#10;  ADMIT --&gt;|放行| REM&#10;  ADMIT --&gt;|退运/弃货| LOSS[成本确认与追偿]&#10;  REM --&gt;|证据达阈| RELEASE[解除暂停]&#10;  REM --&gt;|逾期未闭环| EX&#10;  EX --&gt; SWITCH[双货源切换]&#10;  EX --&gt; RESID[残余敞口结算]&#10;  RELEASE --&gt; BASE[恢复常规准入]&#10;  SWITCH --&gt; BASE\">graph TD\n  EV[风险事件触发] --&gt; TR[应急响应面&lt;br/&gt;停损 / 在途货处置]\n  EV --&gt; REM[整改面&lt;br/&gt;CAP 工单 / 复评]\n  EV --&gt; EX[退出面&lt;br/&gt;替代货源 / 有序终止]\n  TR --&gt; FREEZE[订单冻结与在途隔离]\n  TR --&gt; ADMIT{扣关举证}\n  ADMIT --&gt;|放行| REM\n  ADMIT --&gt;|退运/弃货| LOSS[成本确认与追偿]\n  REM --&gt;|证据达阈| RELEASE[解除暂停]\n  REM --&gt;|逾期未闭环| EX\n  EX --&gt; SWITCH[双货源切换]\n  EX --&gt; RESID[残余敞口结算]\n  RELEASE --&gt; BASE[恢复常规准入]\n  SWITCH --&gt; BASE</pre><p>三个面的<strong>时钟性质完全不同</strong>，这是把响应设计成三条并行流水线而非单一流程的原因：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>事件类型</th>\n<th>触发源</th>\n<th>首要动作</th>\n<th>硬时钟</th>\n<th>决策权</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>海关扣关</td>\n<td>UFLPA 可反驳推定 / WRO / EU 主管机关</td>\n<td>隔离在途货、启动举证包</td>\n<td>法定举证窗口（通常以工作日计）</td>\n<td>进口商合规负责人</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>供应商暂停</td>\n<td>Critical 风险评分 / 审计未闭环</td>\n<td>冻结新订单、存量限期</td>\n<td>客户交付承诺期</td>\n<td>采购 + 合规联合</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>平台/客户下架</td>\n<td>平台 ESG 政策 / 客户尽调</td>\n<td>提供溯源证据包</td>\n<td>平台整改答复期限</td>\n<td>大客户经理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>监管核查</td>\n<td>CSDDD 主管机关问询</td>\n<td>调取活动链证据</td>\n<td>法定答复期</td>\n<td>法务</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>三类面的共同前置是<strong>在途货可见性</strong>：系统必须能实时回答「此刻有多少货、在哪个节点、绑定了哪个供应商、命中哪条风险域」。这一点直接依赖链路溯源数据的完整度——如果 BOM 穿透只到 Tier-1，扣关时连举证包的原料段都拼不出来（见同章 <a href=\"supply-chain-traceability-ntier\">供应链溯源与 N 级映射</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"扣关响应-举证窗口与放行-退运决策\">扣关响应：举证窗口与放行/退运决策</h2><p>美国侧把举证责任<strong>倒置</strong>给进口商。UFLPA 自 2022 年 6 月 21 日起对涉疆货物实行可反驳推定：CBP 扣留后，进口商要么在窗口内证明货物与该推定无关，要么退运（<a href=\"https://www.dhs.gov/uflpa-entity-list\">DHS UFLPA Entity List</a>）。举证包不是一份声明，而是<strong>可交叉验证的链路证据</strong>：采购订单与合同、提单与商业发票、生产记录与工时卡、工资支付凭证、原材料采购凭证。CBP 审查的核心是「证据链能否闭合到产地」——一份缺失上游采购凭证的自我声明，在实务中几乎不会被采信。</p>\n<p>欧盟侧走的是另一条路径。Regulation (EU) 2024/3015 禁止在欧盟市场投放或出口使用强迫劳动制造的产品，<strong>自 2027 年 12 月 14 日起适用</strong>，授权成员国主管机关在风险评估后命令撤回、召回或销毁产品，并处以罚款（<a href=\"https://eur-lex.europa.eu/legal-content/EN/TXT/?uri=OJ:L_202403015\">EUR-Lex L_202403015</a>）。与 UFLPA 的口岸扣留不同，欧盟机制是<strong>事后市场监督</strong>——产品可能已经销售，触发的是召回而非暂扣，处置成本结构因此完全不同。</p>\n<p>放行/退运不是二选一，而是三选项的成本比较。设举证窗口剩余 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 天，仓储与滞港费按日计 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>h</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_h</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，举证成功概率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span>，则响应成本 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>respond</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>legal</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>h</mi></msub><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>export</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>disposal</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{respond}} = C_{\\text{legal}} + c_h t + (1-p)(C_{\\text{export}} + C_{\\text{disposal}})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">respond</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">legal</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">export</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">disposal</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，立即退运成本 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>export now</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mi>C</mi><mtext>freight</mtext><mtext>back</mtext></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>disposal</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>M</mi><mtext>lost</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{export now}} = C_{\\text{freight}}^{\\text{back}} + C_{\\text{disposal}} + M_{\\text{lost}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">export now</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2683em;vertical-align:-0.4192em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4169em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">freight</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">back</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4192em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">disposal</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">lost</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，取两者较小值。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span> 可通过举证包完成度作先验（已采集 Tier-1 至 Tier-3 凭证的显著高于仅到 Tier-1 的），而非拍一个主观概率。</p>\n<p>有个容易忽略的陷阱：<strong>主动弃货不是免责</strong>。弃货只解决物理在途货，不解决实体清单命中带来的后续批次风险——同一供应商、同一产区的下一批货会再次被扣。因此第一件事不是算成本，而是判断命中是<strong>批次级</strong>（可举证澄清）还是<strong>实体级</strong>（需结构性替换）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"供应商暂停与解封闸门\">供应商暂停与解封闸门</h2><p>暂停（suspension）与退出是两个不同的状态，中间隔着「可整改」与「不可整改」的分界：对可整改的供应商直接终止会伤害上游工人且承担切换成本，对不可整改的供应商反复给整改期则延长敞口。状态机应显式建模为四态，每态绑定可执行动作：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>状态</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>采购动作</th>\n<th>允许的迁移</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>Active</code></td>\n<td>正常准入</td>\n<td>正常下单</td>\n<td>触发即转 <code>Quarantined</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Quarantined</code></td>\n<td>观察，存量可交付、新单受限</td>\n<td>冻结新品/新 SKU</td>\n<td>证据达阈 → <code>Active</code>；逾期 → <code>Suspended</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Suspended</code></td>\n<td>硬停，存量限期交付</td>\n<td>停止新订单</td>\n<td>整改闭环 → <code>Quarantined</code>；失败 → <code>Offboarded</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Offboarded</code></td>\n<td>结构性退出</td>\n<td>无新单，执行退出计划</td>\n<td>终态</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>解封闸门必须是<strong>三条件合取</strong>而非单一证据：根因消除（缺陷不再复现）、体系性证据（不是一次性补救，如制度文件 + 一段时间的运行记录）、独立复核（Doer ≠ Judge，由非整改方裁定）。只有第二条是常见缺漏——一份「已整改」的声明与一条足以证明制度有效的运行记录，是完全不同的证据强度。暂停触发阈值应直接复用风险评分口径（见同章 <a href=\"esg-risk-taxonomy-scoring\">供应链 ESG 风险分类与分级评分</a>），但<strong>触发器要允许非评分来源</strong>：审计的 Major 缺陷、扣关历史、客户投诉在评分体系里往往滞后，必须作为旁路信号直接进入状态机。评分是常规门控，事件是紧急门控，两者共用状态机但走不同的触发通道。</p>\n<h2 id=\"整改计划-cap-的工程化\">整改计划（CAP）的工程化</h2><p>CAP（Corrective Action Plan）失败的原因几乎从不是「没有计划」，而是<strong>证据不可验证</strong>。把它当一个有 schema 的工件：缺陷引用风险域与条款、根因（5-Why 或鱼骨）、措施、责任人、时限、证据类型、验证方法。缺陷分级决定时限，而时限必须与实际可完成性对齐——给「更换二级供应商」派 30 天是不负责任的：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Critical</strong>：实体清单命中、强迫劳动指控、未成年用工。措施通常是<strong>立即停止</strong>而非整改，时限以天计。</li>\n<li><strong>Major</strong>：审计发现的管理体系断点（无工时记录、无化学品台账）。30–90 天，需体系证据。</li>\n<li><strong>Minor</strong>：记录不全、培训缺漏。90–180 天，可与年度复评合并。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>CAP 关闭不能靠「责任人点了完成」，需要证据权重达阈。设证据项 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 有类型权重 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 与可信度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>e</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">e_i \\in [0,1]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6891em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span>（第三方审计 &gt; 现场核查 &gt; 供应商自证 &gt; 邮件声明），关闭条件 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></msub><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><msub><mi>e</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>≥</mo><msub><mi>θ</mi><mtext>CAP</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E = \\sum_i w_i e_i \\geq \\theta_{\\text{CAP}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0497em;vertical-align:-0.2997em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.162em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">CAP</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>θ</mi><mtext>CAP</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta_{\\text{CAP}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">CAP</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 按缺陷等级递增——Critical 缺陷不应允许用自证材料关闭。把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>e</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">e_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 显式建模的价值在于：它让「供应商说整改了」和「审计员现场确认整改了」在系统里有不同的重量。复评周期与风险域绑定，且必须<strong>在 CAP 关闭后重新计时</strong>，否则会出现「整改刚闭环、复评立刻到期」的空转。</p>\n<h2 id=\"替代供应与退出-切换成本与有序终止\">替代供应与退出：切换成本与有序终止</h2><p>退出是三个面里最贵的，因为它的成本发生在<strong>未来</strong>（爬坡、认证、客户重新批准），而收益是<strong>避免的损失</strong>（概率性）。这个不对称让退出决策极易被拖延。切换成本可粗略分解：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>switch</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>tooling</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>qual</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>Q</mi><mtext>ramp</mtext></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>p</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>dual-run</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{switch}} = C_{\\text{tooling}} + C_{\\text{qual}} + Q_{\\text{ramp}} \\cdot \\Delta p + C_{\\text{dual-run}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">switch</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">tooling</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">qual</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">ramp</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">dual-run</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>dual-run</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{dual-run}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">dual-run</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是双跑期（新旧货源并行供货以验证良率）的重叠成本，实务中最常被低估——它等于在切换完成前同时持有两条供应链的全部固定成本。</p>\n<p>退出不是「终止合同」这一个动作，而是一组并行闸门，缺一不可：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  EXIT[退出决策] --&gt; G1{替代货源认证完成?}&#10;  G1 --&gt;|否| HOLD[延后退出&lt;br/&gt;维持 Quarantined]&#10;  G1 --&gt;|是| G2{模具/工装交付?}&#10;  G2 --&gt;|否| RISK[产能断档风险]&#10;  G2 --&gt;|是| G3{客户重新批准?}&#10;  G3 --&gt;|否| HOLD&#10;  G3 --&gt;|是| G4{上游工人安置评估?}&#10;  G4 --&gt;|未评估| RESPO[负责任退出程序]&#10;  G4 --&gt;|已评估| DONE[执行切换与结算]\">flowchart TD\n  EXIT[退出决策] --&gt; G1{替代货源认证完成?}\n  G1 --&gt;|否| HOLD[延后退出&lt;br/&gt;维持 Quarantined]\n  G1 --&gt;|是| G2{模具/工装交付?}\n  G2 --&gt;|否| RISK[产能断档风险]\n  G2 --&gt;|是| G3{客户重新批准?}\n  G3 --&gt;|否| HOLD\n  G3 --&gt;|是| G4{上游工人安置评估?}\n  G4 --&gt;|未评估| RESPO[负责任退出程序]\n  G4 --&gt;|已评估| DONE[执行切换与结算]</pre><p>最后一道闸门是<strong>负责任退出（responsible exit）</strong>。OECD 的负责任商业行为框架明确反对「一刀切式终止」：在强迫劳动语境下立即切断订单，可能把工人推入更无保障的处境，且会削弱后续改善的杠杆。正确做法是评估自身采购行为对上游的影响、给出通知期、在可行时协助过渡，并把「已评估」作为退出流程的强制节点而非道德倡议——这与商业切换成本是两笔账，必须分别记录。</p>\n<h2 id=\"事件响应的可审计性与演练\">事件响应的可审计性与演练</h2><p>监管尽调与客户尽调问的是<strong>过程证据</strong>，不是结论。「你怎么知道这家供应商已经整改」的答案必须落在一串带时间戳的记录上：何时触发、谁决策、依据什么证据、何时复评。可度量的指标至少四个：<strong>响应时长</strong>（触发到首个动作，扣关类应以小时计）、<strong>CAP 按期关闭率</strong>、<strong>复发率</strong>、<strong>举证成功率</strong>。前两个是过程指标，后两个是效果指标——只看响应速度会鼓励「快速打勾」，必须配复发率交叉验证。</p>\n<p>桌面演练（tabletop exercise）是把响应能力从文档变成肌肉记忆的低成本手段：给定一个虚构的扣留通知，检验系统能否在时限内自动列出在途货、拼出链路证据、生成退运成本估算。演练报告里最有价值的不是「通过了」，而是<strong>发现哪些字段根本没有采集</strong>——那通常是数据模型缺口，不是流程缺口。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>风险事件的核心特征是<strong>不可逆时钟</strong>；响应应拆成应急响应、整改、退出三条并行流水线，而非单一流程。</li>\n<li>扣关（UFLPA/WRO）把举证责任倒置给进口商，举证包必须闭合到产地；欧盟 2024/3015 走事后市场监督路径（2027-12-14 起适用），触发召回而非暂扣。</li>\n<li>放行/退运/弃货是三选项成本比较；<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span> 应绑定举证包完成度而非主观概率，主动弃货不解决实体级命中。</li>\n<li>暂停与退出之间隔「可整改」分界，状态机（<code>Active/Quarantined/Suspended/Offboarded</code>）应显式建模；解封需根因消除、体系证据、独立复核三条件合取。</li>\n<li>CAP 的成败在证据可验证性：用权重 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 与可信度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>e</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">e_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 建模证据强度，Critical 缺陷不允许用自证材料关闭。</li>\n<li>退出成本发生在未来、收益是概率性的，极易拖延；切换成本须含双跑重叠成本，「上游工人安置评估」是强制闸门而非倡议。</li>\n<li>可审计性是过程证据链；用响应时长、按期关闭率、复发率、举证成功率交叉度量，避免只优化速度。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本文的处置流程以风险分级与溯源数据为输入。风险域划分与评分口径见同章 <a href=\"esg-risk-taxonomy-scoring\">供应链 ESG 风险分类与分级评分</a>；举证所需的链路证据来自 <a href=\"supply-chain-traceability-ntier\">供应链溯源与 N 级映射</a>；整改后的审计复评口径见 <a href=\"../esg-supplier-qualification-data/thirdparty-esg-audit-scoring\">第三方 ESG 审计与评分归一化</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"高风险事件响应、整改与退出（扣关/暂停/替代供应）","id":"高风险事件响应-整改与退出-扣关-暂停-替代供应"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"扣关响应：举证窗口与放行/退运决策","id":"扣关响应-举证窗口与放行-退运决策"},{"level":2,"text":"供应商暂停与解封闸门","id":"供应商暂停与解封闸门"},{"level":2,"text":"整改计划（CAP）的工程化","id":"整改计划-cap-的工程化"},{"level":2,"text":"替代供应与退出：切换成本与有序终止","id":"替代供应与退出-切换成本与有序终止"},{"level":2,"text":"事件响应的可审计性与演练","id":"事件响应的可审计性与演练"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"供应链溯源与 N 级映射（BOM 穿透、冶炼厂/产地级追溯）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/supplier-esg-diversity-sourcing-compliance/supply-chain-esg-risk/supply-chain-traceability-ntier"},"next":{"title":"ESG 合规报告框架与指标口径（CSRD/GRI/SASB/CDP 映射与边界）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/supplier-esg-diversity-sourcing-compliance/reporting-compliance-ops/esg-reporting-framework-metrics"}}